# Project-local data — never push to live site
# Root-level tiers.csv only (legacy stray exports). The canonical
# committed tier source lives at data/source/tiers/tiers.csv and IS
# tracked (see data/source/tiers/README.md for the workflow).
/tiers.csv

# Stray root-level exports / scratch notes. Every real data source lives
# under data/source/ (and IS tracked); nothing at the repo ROOT should ever
# ship. Without this, push.bat's `git add -A` silently commits whatever
# spreadsheet or notes file happens to be sitting here (e.g. the May-21
# "TAT 2026 Dynasty Rankings ... .csv" drop). Root-anchored so data/**.csv
# is unaffected.
/*.csv
/*.txt

